WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=sn.

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.154
Iyo Arclight chirongwa.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:05.633
Nzira yekubvisa sei chirwere chemaziso kana uchigovera magirazi emaziso?

3
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.850
Pakugovera magirazi emaziso zvakakosha kuti usabatanidze zvimwe zvirwere zvemaziso zviri pasi.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.084
Iine acuity acuity chati uye Arclight mudziyo unogona kukurumidza kuona kuti ndiani anoda

5
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:19.318
magirazi uye rudzii uye ndiani angada kutumirwa kune zvimwe zvirwere zvakadai seketani uye

6
00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:23.552
glaucoma.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:30.480
Tanga nechinhambwe chekuona acuity kuyedza ziso rimwe panguva isina rubatsiro uye kana rakaderedzwa shandisa pinhole.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.520
zvino edza pedyo nekuona nemaziso ose pamwechete.

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.920
Pane zvinowanzoitika zvishanu zvinogoneka.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.400
Kana chinhambwe chiri pedyo nekuona acuity zvese zvakanaka,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.780
murwere haadi magirazi.

12
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.160
Kana kuona kure kwakaderedzwa,

13
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.920
asi inovandudza nepinhole uye chiono chepedyo chakanaka,

14
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:53.360
zvino murwere anonyanya kuona zvishoma, anonziwo myopic.

15
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.920
Kana kuona kure kwakaderedzwa asi kuchivandudza nepinhole,

16
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.920
uye chiratidzo chepedyo zvakare chakaderedzwa;

17
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.920
ipapo murwere angangodaro anoona kwenguva refu,

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.920
Iyo inozivikanwawo se hyperopia.

19
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
Kana kuona kure zvakanaka,

20
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
asi chiratidzo chepedyo chipfupi.

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.920
uye murwere ane makore anopfuura 40 ezera,

22
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.920
zvino vadzvanya biopia uye vanoda magirazi ekuverenga.

23
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.920
Pakupedzisira, kana maonero ekuona akaderedzwa

24
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.920
uye haina kuvandudza nepinhole kana magirazi,

25
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
ipapo chirwere chemaziso chiri pasi chinogona kuitika,

26
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.778
murwere anoda kuongororwa nearc light.

27
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:33.270
Enda kune imwe imba ine chiedza chisina kujeka uye tanga neyakananga

28
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.455
pupil light reflex.

29
00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:38.010
Vese vanhu vanofanirwa kusungirira zvakaenzana uye nekukasira kuchiedza.

30
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.590
Kana vasingadaro

31
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.386
Constrict zvakanaka, panogona kunge paine chirwere cheoptic nerve kana retina

32
00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.470
kumashure kwe

33
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.230
ziso, rakadai se glaucoma kana retinal detachment.

34
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.422
Tevere tarisa iyo fundal reflex bvunzo.

35
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:54.710
Yakajeka symmetric reflex zvinoreva kuti hapana chinovharira

36
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.730
chiedza chichipinda muziso.

37
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.770
Kana iyo reflex yakaderedzwa kana isipo, ipapo cataract, corneal

38
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:05.759
vanga, ropa kuseri kweziso kana bundu, zvichida kuvhara chiedza.

39
00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.090
Tevere tarisa kumberi

40
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.396
yeziso, vhara neanterior segment loop.

41
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.710
Tarisa chero hutachiona hwecorneal uye mavanga

42
00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.578
kana cataract.

43
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:18.782
Pakupedzisira, ita optomoscopy yakananga uye tarisa kumashure kweziso.

44
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:19.650
Xammon optic

45
00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
nerve uye retina yezviratidzo zveglaucoma, thyroid retinopathy, mavanga uye retinal

46
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.203
detachment.

47
00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:29.790
Kana chero chirwere chiripo kana iwe haugone kuziva chikonzero nei

48
00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.050
kuona kwemurwere kwakachena, woita hurongwa hwekuti murwere aone chiremba wemaziso.

49
00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.090
Vhidhiyo iyi inoratidza kuti kuburikidza nekudzidzira nekudzidziswa nguva dzose,

50
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.530
vashandi vezvehutano vese, kunyangwe vaine maturusi akaderera, vanogona kunzwisisa kana a

51
00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.610
murwere anobatsirwa nemagirazi emaziso kana kuti anoda kuendeswa kunorapwa

52
00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.104
chirwere.

53
00:02:47.104 --> 00:02:53.530
Nzira ine simba ine imwe yakaderera mutengo chishandiso chero kupi munyika

54
00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.930
chero munhu.
